OL,3,GNEWSALorry fire closes eastbound
OL,4,Acarriageways of A14
OL,5,
OL,6,FA lorry burst into flames on the A14
OL,7,Fearlier, blocking the eastbound
OL,8,Fcarriageways.
OL,10,FCambridgeshire Fire and Rescue said
OL,11,Fcrews were called to the blaze at about
OL,12,F04:25 GMT, between junction 23 for
OL,13,FHuntingdon and junction 24 for
OL,14,FBoxworth.
OL,16,F"Firefighters arrived to find the lorry
OL,17,Fwell alight. Wearing breathing
OL,18,Fapparatus, they used hose reels to
OL,19,Fextinguish the fire," said a
OL,20,Fspokesperson.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
