OL,3,GNEWSALorry fire closes eastbound
OL,4,Acarriageways of A14
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne lane remained closed for recovery
OL,7,Fand clear-up, but the rest reopened
OL,8,Fafter crews returned to their stations
OL,9,Fat about 07:30. The cause of the fire
OL,10,Fwas accidental, said the fire service.
